---
name: entertainment
description: Play music or podcasts. Use when the user asks to play, queue or listen to something.
---
1. Do not ask follow-up questions; play the best match.
2. Report what is now playing in one short sentence.
---
name: lists-and-timers
description: Manage the shopping list and kitchen timers. Use for adding items, reading the list, or starting timers.
---
1. Add one item per add_item call.
2. Always read back what was added.
3. Timers take minutes (decimals allowed) and a short label.
---
name: smart-home
description: Control lights and the thermostat. Use when the user mentions lights, brightness, temperature or heating.
---
1. Default room is "living" if none is given.
2. A brightness value implies the light is on.
3. Thermostat range is 16-30 C. Confirm the final value to the user.
